CONNECT front-crossaxle-1.axle7~ -> fuselage-lower-beam-2.hole4~ TURNS
CONNECT nose-front-crossaxle-1.axle4~ -> fuselage-lower-beam-2.hole1 TURNS
CONNECT nose-shortpin-2.pin2 -> fuselage-lower-beam-2.hole2 STIFF
CONNECT nose-axlepin-2.axle1~ -> fuselage-lower-beam-2.hole4~ TURNS
WHY Closes the lower fuselage with the matching side beam and rear spacer around the nose mounting axles.
STEP 18
GROUP fuselage-side-left
ADD side-connector-1 32034 white
ADD side-join-axle-1 32062 red
ADD side-tail-axle-1 4519 yellow
CONNECT side-join-axle-1.axle1 -> side-connector-1.axlehole1 LOCKED
CONNECT side-tail-axle-1.axle1 -> side-connector-1.axlehole2 LOCKED
