CONNECT nose-skin-slope-2.underside? -> nose-skin-plate-1.stud6? STIFF
CONNECT nose-skin-socket-1.stud1? -> nose-skin-plate-1.underside? STIFF
CONNECT nose-skin-inverted-1.stud1? -> nose-skin-plate-1.underside? STIFF
